        "text": "<p>The True Classic Novelty Polo is a versatile option for men who want something more polished than a T-shirt without giving up everyday comfort. Its contemporary athletic cut is shaped around the shoulders and chest while leaving enough room for movement, giving the shirt a cleaner silhouette without feeling overly restrictive. The fabric is designed with comfort and performance in mind. Depending on the specific version, the polo uses a soft cotton-polyester blend, with one listed version featuring a 60% cotton and 40% polyester composition. The material is described as moisture-wicking and quick-drying, with odor-control technology that makes it suitable for warmer days and active use. A classic collar and three-button placket keep the design easy to dress up or down. You can wear it with chinos for work, shorts for a casual weekend, or golf pants for a round on the course. The UPF 30 rating also adds useful sun protection for outdoor wear. </p>",
